  "id": "parenting-stress-index",
  "term": "Parenting Stress Index",
  "definition": "The Parenting Stress Index is a questionnaire used to assess parenting stress, meaning the tension a parent feels in response to the demands of raising a child. It can provide overall stress scores and subdomain scores that reflect different sources of stress in the parent-child relationship.",
